* Independent transistor V-to-I servo candidate. No ideal internal amplifier.
* EXTERNAL boundaries: VSET=0.5V, RSET=5k from sense to vss; neither is a bandgap.
* External nominal RBIAS=100k and compensation Cc are included here as passive
* schematic components; no layout/junction/routing extraction for this circuit.
* Pin order: supply, ground, external voltage setpoint, sense/RSET, sourced output.
.subckt vset_reference vdd vss vset sense iout params: RBIAS=100k CC=3p
* Actual diode PMOS/resistor tail bias (accuracy not used to set current).
XPBIAS pb pb vdd vdd pfet_06v0 w=20u l=4u
RBIAS pb vss {RBIAS}
XPTAIL tail pb vdd vdd pfet_06v0 w=20u l=4u
* PMOS input pair and NMOS mirror load; VSET>VSENSE raises n2.
XPD1 n1 vset tail vdd pfet_06v0 w=100u l=10u
XPD2 n2 sense tail vdd pfet_06v0 w=100u l=10u
XND1 n1 n1 vss vss nfet_06v0 w=50u l=10u
XND2 n2 n1 vss vss nfet_06v0 w=50u l=10u
* NMOS common-source second stage with diode PMOS load.
XNSTAGE ctrl n2 vss vss nfet_06v0 w=20u l=1u
XPLOAD ctrl ctrl vdd vdd pfet_06v0 w=100u l=10u
* Matched long-channel PMOS source legs: REG closes loop, OUT supplies pixel.
XPREG sense ctrl vdd vdd pfet_06v0 w=100u l=10u
XPOUT iout ctrl vdd vdd pfet_06v0 w=100u l=10u
* Explicit schematic Miller compensation, not an extracted physical capacitor.
CCOMP n2 ctrl {CC}
.ends vset_reference
